WEBVTT

00:01.590 --> 00:02.970
<b>Mr. Ryoma!</b>

00:02.970 --> 00:07.930
<b>I'm going to move to a dormitory
in the capital soon!</b>

00:07.930 --> 00:12.020
<b>This is the first time
I'm moving and living alone.</b>

00:12.020 --> 00:17.770
<b>I haven't told my family this,
but I have to admit I'm a bit scared.</b>

00:17.770 --> 00:18.730
<b>But!</b>

00:18.730 --> 00:23.450
<b>I always get my emotional support
from Mr. Ryoma, so I'll be fine.</b>

00:23.450 --> 00:27.780
<b>I think there's a festival
coming up in your town soon.</b>

00:27.780 --> 00:30.750
<b>Please enjoy, along with
the people at your shop!</b>

00:30.750 --> 00:33.080
<b>Elia is moving out!</b>

00:33.080 --> 00:35.920
<b>It'd be great if I could
send her a gift or something.</b>

00:35.920 --> 00:39.050
<b>But what should I give?</b>

00:39.050 --> 00:41.670
<b>Oh, I remember, Miss Carla said once...</b>

00:41.670 --> 00:46.180
<b>Between people who are close,
gifts of clothing is possible.</b>

00:46.180 --> 00:52.230
<b>It symbolizes the wish to
make their new life go well.</b>

00:52.230 --> 00:54.480
<b>Or something along those lines.</b>

00:54.480 --> 00:58.270
<b>Hmm, I don't know how to
pick clothes, though.</b>

00:58.270 --> 01:02.690
<b>I don't even know what styles
are in vogue or whatever.</b>

01:02.690 --> 01:04.660
<b>What else...</b>

01:04.660 --> 01:09.120
<b>Flowers... Gift cards... Gold coins...</b>

01:09.120 --> 01:10.370
<b>No way.</b>

01:10.370 --> 01:13.250
<b>Cleaner slime deodorant solution...</b>

01:13.250 --> 01:16.670
<b>Something consumable that
won't be a bother to have around...</b>

01:16.670 --> 01:20.300
<b>Something handmade would be
nice for this occasion...</b>

01:20.300 --> 01:21.760
<b>I know!</b>

01:37.980 --> 01:40.110
<b>All good.</b>

01:40.110 --> 01:43.240
<b>Now I just have to let it sit for a while.</b>

01:43.240 --> 01:46.320
<b>Handmade soap, done!</b>

01:46.320 --> 01:50.120
<b>No, I can do better. If I change
the composition a little,</b>

01:50.120 --> 01:54.620
<b>I can improve the foam, feel,
and other effects!</b>

01:54.620 --> 01:59.290
<b>I know, I can also give it
a look that Elia might like!</b>

02:02.710 --> 02:04.340
<b>Done!</b>

02:08.840 --> 02:13.770
<b>Hmm, Elia mentioned
a festival in her letter.</b>

02:13.770 --> 02:15.770
<b>I wonder what that's about.</b>

03:45.980 --> 03:50.990
<b>"Episode 7"
"Ryoma and the Local Cuisine"</b>

03:57.160 --> 04:00.160
<b>Mr. Callum, can I have
a moment of your time?</b>

04:00.160 --> 04:02.830
<b>Yes, Manager, how can I help?</b>

04:02.830 --> 04:06.670
<b>I heard there's a festival
coming up in this town soon.</b>

04:06.670 --> 04:09.460
<b>I wonder if you knew anything about that.</b>

04:10.420 --> 04:13.840
<b>Not to my knowledge.
Should I look into it?</b>

04:13.840 --> 04:18.100
<b>Oh, there's no need for that. Thank you.</b>

04:18.100 --> 04:23.270
<b>Hmm, perhaps someone who's lived in
this town for a long time might know.</b>

04:23.270 --> 04:27.070
<b>I see. I know someone
who grew up in this town!</b>

04:28.400 --> 04:30.650
<b>Mr. Dolce, excuse me.</b>

04:30.650 --> 04:31.820
<b>What is it?</b>

04:31.820 --> 04:34.530
<b>There's something I wanted to ask you.</b>

04:34.530 --> 04:39.040
<b>Hmm. A festival around this time.
That might be the Founding Festival.</b>

04:39.040 --> 04:40.540
<b>The Founding Festival?</b>

04:40.540 --> 04:43.790
<b>It's a festival celebrating
the founding of this town.</b>

04:43.790 --> 04:45.960
<b>What happens during that festival?</b>

04:45.960 --> 04:49.670
<b>A band of traveling entertainers
come and perform.</b>

04:49.670 --> 04:53.010
<b>Also, many stalls open up
along the main street.</b>

04:53.010 --> 04:56.510
<b>Stalls? Do all the shops participate?</b>

04:56.510 --> 05:02.230
<b>No. Anyone can apply to open a stall,
but it's not mandatory.</b>

05:02.230 --> 05:03.940
<b>A stall...</b>

05:03.940 --> 05:09.400
<b>If our employees are interested,
it might be worth a try...</b>

05:09.400 --> 05:14.570
<b>After the festival, the residents sometimes
do a town-wide cleaning activity.</b>

05:14.570 --> 05:20.870
<b>I see. My shop gets a lot of support
from this town, so I'd love to help out.</b>

05:20.870 --> 05:25.040
<b>I see. Well, that's all I know.</b>

05:25.040 --> 05:28.290
<b>Understood, thank you.</b>

05:28.290 --> 05:30.130
<b>Don't mention it.</b>

05:30.130 --> 05:36.300
<b>Coming to think of it, the people at my shop
are all from out of town, including myself.</b>

05:36.300 --> 05:37.430
<b>I see.</b>

05:37.430 --> 05:40.970
<b>Yes. Mr. Callum was introduced
to us through Mr. Serge,</b>

05:40.970 --> 05:43.810
<b>and is from a town called Louiam.</b>

05:43.810 --> 05:47.520
<b>Mr. Fay and Miss Li Ling are
from a country called Gilmar,</b>

05:47.520 --> 05:52.030
<b>and Miss Selma worked at
an inn in a different town.</b>

05:52.030 --> 05:58.160
<b>Miss Jane, Miss Fina, and Miss Maria
are all from the same village.</b>

05:58.160 --> 06:03.160
<b>I'm so glad to have a local in touch with
the community like you here, Mr. Dolce.</b>

06:03.160 --> 06:05.160
<b>I see.</b>

06:05.160 --> 06:06.540
<b>Manager.</b>

06:06.540 --> 06:07.790
<b>What is it?</b>

06:07.790 --> 06:11.710
<b>My sister just sent word from Lenaf.</b>

06:11.710 --> 06:16.470
<b>Miss Carla? Did something happen
at the second shop?</b>

06:16.470 --> 06:19.300
<b>Yes. Apparently, the cleaner slimes
at the second shop</b>

06:19.300 --> 06:22.390
<b>suddenly started to multiply rapidly.</b>

06:22.390 --> 06:24.100
<b>The cleaner slimes?!</b>

06:24.100 --> 06:26.140
<b>Yes. There were too many,</b>

06:26.140 --> 06:29.060
<b>so Mr. Caulkin and the others were not able
to enter into a contract with all of them.</b>

06:29.060 --> 06:32.610
<b>Understood. I'll head over
there immediately!</b>

06:36.280 --> 06:40.410
<b>The slimes seem happy
to have more friends.</b>

06:40.410 --> 06:42.120
<b>Let's get there fast!</b>

06:49.750 --> 06:53.250
<b>Wow, what a crowd.</b>

06:53.250 --> 06:54.460
<b>Manager!</b>

06:54.460 --> 06:58.380
<b>I heard the cleaner slimes multiplied.</b>

06:58.380 --> 07:00.680
<b>Yes. This way.</b>

07:00.680 --> 07:03.140
<b>Oh, Manager!</b>

07:03.140 --> 07:06.810
<b>This is... quite a lot.</b>

07:06.810 --> 07:10.650
<b>Are these all of
the non-contracted slimes?</b>

07:10.650 --> 07:14.110
<b>Yes. There are 75 total.</b>

07:14.110 --> 07:18.700
<b>That's quite a growth rate. I need to
finish up the contract right away!</b>

07:21.820 --> 07:24.620
<b>All right, taming contract complete!</b>

07:24.620 --> 07:27.870
<b>Looking forward to working
with you, cleaner slimes.</b>

07:28.790 --> 07:32.920
<b>Wow, he really tamed all of them.</b>

07:32.920 --> 07:37.300
<b>Can you think of any reason
why they multiplied so fast?</b>

07:37.300 --> 07:40.720
<b>We already investigated that.</b>

07:40.720 --> 07:45.600
<b>This is... Impressive,
in such a short time-frame.</b>

07:45.600 --> 07:47.680
<b>I think it's a great report.</b>

07:47.680 --> 07:51.190
<b>Lobelia and Tony helped, too.</b>

07:51.190 --> 07:55.400
<b>I see. The cleaner slimes
stocked up on a lot of nutrition,</b>

07:55.400 --> 07:59.650
<b>so they started making more
deodorizing solution than we could sell.</b>

07:59.650 --> 08:02.990
<b>So we put a limit to the deodorizing
solution production,</b>

08:02.990 --> 08:06.620
<b>but then they began to multiply.</b>

08:06.620 --> 08:11.120
<b>Unless we let them spend some of
their energy, they'll continue to multiply.</b>

08:11.120 --> 08:14.670
<b>Moving forward, we plan to not limit
their production of deodorizing solution.</b>

08:14.670 --> 08:19.300
<b>Instead, we'll just discard the excess.
That should prevent this.</b>

08:20.590 --> 08:25.260
<b>That sounds good.
Please proceed in that way.</b>

08:25.260 --> 08:30.350
<b>They identified the cause
and came up with a good solution...</b>

08:30.350 --> 08:34.480
<b>I'm so glad these people
came to work with me.</b>

08:34.480 --> 08:36.980
<b>After that, I spent the whole night</b>

08:36.980 --> 08:40.990
<b>discussing slimes with
Mr. Caulkin and the others.</b>

08:47.280 --> 08:52.870
<b>I guess I should say hi to
Mr. Pioro before I leave.</b>

08:58.130 --> 09:00.710
<b>Hmm? What's that?</b>

09:03.590 --> 09:05.470
<b>What's that smell?!</b>

09:05.470 --> 09:08.930
<b>Hey, Ryoma! Good timing!</b>

09:08.930 --> 09:12.310
<b>Mr. Pioro, what's going on?</b>

09:12.310 --> 09:15.980
<b>Some of my younger staff
brought in some weird stuff.</b>

09:15.980 --> 09:20.230
<b>It's called "shappaya." Fermented fish.</b>

09:22.400 --> 09:25.860
<b>Check it out. Ugh, the smell!</b>

09:25.860 --> 09:31.240
<b>They say it makes great preserved food,
but the smell gets everywhere.</b>

09:31.240 --> 09:35.040
<b>I guess it's like "kusaya"
from back on Earth?</b>

09:35.040 --> 09:37.790
<b>Ryoma, can you do something
about this smell?</b>

09:37.790 --> 09:39.340
<b>Some kind of cool trick?</b>

09:39.340 --> 09:42.840
<b>As usual, he has no reservation
with making requests.</b>

09:42.840 --> 09:44.300
<b>Wait...</b>

09:44.300 --> 09:50.100
<b>Your new item will greatly improve
the lives of cat beastkin!</b>

09:50.100 --> 09:52.970
<b>I have nothing but
the highest hopes for it!</b>

09:52.970 --> 09:58.440
<b>I just thought of something.
Can I run a little experiment?</b>

09:58.440 --> 10:03.230
<b>Yes! This smell is chasing our
customers away. Please do something.</b>

10:03.230 --> 10:07.990
<b>Got it. Come here, deodorant slime.</b>

10:09.990 --> 10:13.080
<b>What's this? Another new slime?</b>

10:13.080 --> 10:19.330
<b>This is a deodorant slime.
It can make a fluid that absorbs smells.</b>

10:19.330 --> 10:23.000
<b>This is different from the deodorizing
solution that you sell?</b>

10:23.000 --> 10:29.550
<b>Yes. The deodorizing solution wasn't good
for dampening the smell over a large area.</b>

10:29.550 --> 10:32.430
<b>But this deodorant slime can.</b>

10:32.430 --> 10:35.390
<b>Go, deodorant slime!</b>

10:41.230 --> 10:42.900
<b>Wow!</b>

10:47.490 --> 10:50.200
<b>That smell is all gone!</b>

10:50.200 --> 10:53.370
<b>The effect should only last
about a day or so.</b>

10:53.370 --> 10:56.500
<b>Here's a bag of
the odor absorption solution.</b>

10:56.500 --> 11:02.290
<b>Wow, thanks, Ryoma!
I have to repay you in some way.</b>

11:03.840 --> 11:09.220
<b>In that case, could you let me know
how long the odor absorption effect lasts?</b>

11:09.220 --> 11:11.220
<b>That's all?</b>

11:11.220 --> 11:15.430
<b>It would help me a lot
if I could get the experiment results.</b>

11:15.430 --> 11:17.520
<b>You're too modest.</b>

11:17.520 --> 11:21.940
<b>Oh, I know! At least,
take a barrel of shappaya.</b>

11:21.940 --> 11:23.110
<b>This one?</b>

11:23.110 --> 11:28.240
<b>Yeah. When traveling down a path with
many monsters, just open this up and...</b>

11:30.110 --> 11:32.570
<b>It still smells!</b>

11:32.570 --> 11:35.830
<b>There, you'll send the monsters running.</b>

11:35.830 --> 11:38.500
<b>Oh, I didn't know you could do that!</b>

11:38.500 --> 11:39.960
<b>Thank you.</b>

11:39.960 --> 11:42.830
<b>Don't mention it. Have a safe trip back.</b>

11:42.830 --> 11:48.670
<b>I will! Oh, by the way, I wanted to say hi
to Miss Miyabi before I left.</b>

11:48.670 --> 11:50.470
<b>Is she here?</b>

11:50.470 --> 11:56.350
<b>Oh, Miyabi is on her way
to the royal capital now.</b>

11:56.350 --> 11:58.980
<b>Probably taking a nap in the carriage.</b>

11:59.810 --> 12:02.350
<b>Oh, the capital...</b>

12:02.350 --> 12:05.980
<b>Miss Miyabi, are you going to the academy?</b>

12:05.980 --> 12:11.150
<b>Yeah, to make connections
as a future businessperson.</b>

12:11.150 --> 12:17.370
<b>If she left a little later, I would have
had her take some shappaya, too.</b>

12:18.490 --> 12:22.960
<b>I get the feeling
she wouldn't have enjoyed that...</b>

12:23.790 --> 12:27.050
<b>Are you constantly absorbing
while you're with me?</b>

12:28.920 --> 12:32.970
<b>I'm sorry! Please, no more!</b>

12:36.050 --> 12:38.260
<b>There!</b>

12:39.680 --> 12:44.980
<b>Like Mr. Pioro said, the shappaya
helped make my trip home safe.</b>

12:44.980 --> 12:47.610
<b>Manager, you're back.</b>

12:47.610 --> 12:52.650
<b>Yes, the issue with the cleaner
slimes was taken care of.</b>

12:52.650 --> 12:58.200
<b>That's good to hear. Mr. Serge wanted to
schedule a meeting with you.</b>

12:58.200 --> 13:02.370
<b>Understood. Should I head over
to the Morgan Trading Company?</b>

13:02.370 --> 13:06.460
<b>No, he wanted to visit you here.</b>

13:06.460 --> 13:10.250
<b>Please let him know
I'm available at any time.</b>

13:10.250 --> 13:14.300
<b>Understood. Also, one more thing.</b>

13:14.300 --> 13:15.840
<b>What is it?</b>

13:15.840 --> 13:20.640
<b>The village where Miss Fina
and the others are from sent a gift.</b>

13:20.640 --> 13:27.310
<b>I think Miss Jane is on her break now.
She should be able to give you the details.</b>

13:30.070 --> 13:34.490
<b>Sorry, Manager. Our parents
did this without telling us...</b>

13:34.490 --> 13:37.620
<b>This is, um...</b>

13:37.620 --> 13:38.830
<b>A bribe.</b>

13:38.830 --> 13:40.700
<b>Wow! So direct!</b>

13:40.700 --> 13:43.910
<b>It's not uncommon to see gifts like this.</b>

13:43.910 --> 13:50.340
<b>I think some parents want to ensure
their children are treated well.</b>

13:50.340 --> 13:51.630
<b>I see.</b>

13:51.630 --> 13:54.550
<b>They wanted to thank the manager
and the other coworkers,</b>

13:54.550 --> 13:58.300
<b>so they sent wheat and semesa.</b>

13:58.300 --> 13:59.390
<b>Semesa?</b>

13:59.390 --> 14:02.350
<b>Oh, it's a local crop from our village.</b>

14:02.350 --> 14:04.310
<b>I see...</b>

14:06.020 --> 14:10.650
<b>It has a pleasant fragrance.
It might be a good way to flavor foods.</b>

14:10.650 --> 14:15.950
<b>I guess it's like sesame from Earth?
I'm grateful, but...</b>

14:15.950 --> 14:18.360
<b>This is quite a large amount,
it must be a burden.</b>

14:18.360 --> 14:20.830
<b>Oh, don't worry about that.</b>

14:20.830 --> 14:23.830
<b>Actually, they're leftovers
that couldn't be sold.</b>

14:23.830 --> 14:27.080
<b>Th-That sounds worrying...</b>

14:27.080 --> 14:29.210
<b>Yes... Perhaps.</b>

14:29.210 --> 14:34.510
<b>Um, please let them know that they
shouldn't send gifts like this.</b>

14:34.510 --> 14:38.180
<b>This won't change how you're treated.</b>

14:38.180 --> 14:41.300
<b>I understand. I'm sorry.</b>

14:41.300 --> 14:47.020
<b>I've never been a parent before,
so I can only imagine, but...</b>

14:47.020 --> 14:51.110
<b>This must be because they care
deeply about you, so it's all right.</b>

14:51.110 --> 14:52.820
<b>Manager...</b>

14:52.820 --> 14:57.990
<b>I'll pay the proper price
for the wheat and semesa.</b>

14:57.990 --> 15:01.370
<b>Oh, no, that would be too much!</b>

15:01.370 --> 15:03.660
<b>They sent it over without even asking.</b>

15:03.660 --> 15:07.830
<b>We can use it to cook at our shop,
please don't worry.</b>

15:07.830 --> 15:12.290
<b>Also, if they keep
sending out inventory for free,</b>

15:12.290 --> 15:15.090
<b>it'll only further drive down the prices.</b>

15:15.090 --> 15:20.300
<b>I want to pay the proper price,
for the sake of the wheat and semesa.</b>

15:20.300 --> 15:23.720
<b>At the very least, please pay
as little as possible for it, then.</b>

15:23.720 --> 15:29.600
<b>In that case, how about
base cost plus shipping?</b>

15:29.600 --> 15:32.400
<b>That sounds okay.</b>

15:32.400 --> 15:34.610
<b>Thanks, Manager.</b>

15:34.610 --> 15:37.820
<b>It's the least I can do.</b>

15:38.780 --> 15:41.910
<b>I'll talk to Mr. Pioro sometime soon.</b>

15:41.910 --> 15:44.910
<b>If the wheat and semesa
are of good quality,</b>

15:44.910 --> 15:48.120
<b>perhaps he can start
buying from the village.</b>

15:51.750 --> 15:54.630
<b>First, an update on the current situation.</b>

15:56.840 --> 15:59.800
<b>A music box... Is it already complete?</b>

15:59.800 --> 16:06.390
<b>Yes. This is just a sample,
but we're already lined up to start sales.</b>

16:06.390 --> 16:11.270
<b>They're building up
general inventory as we speak.</b>

16:11.270 --> 16:14.650
<b>We're thinking of revealing these
at the Founding Festival.</b>

16:14.650 --> 16:18.820
<b>The Founding Festival...
So do you plan to sell them at stalls?</b>

16:18.820 --> 16:23.360
<b>Yes. The tune to be played was
provided to us by the Semroid Troupe,</b>

16:23.360 --> 16:26.620
<b>who will be performing at the festival.</b>

16:26.620 --> 16:31.120
<b>The Semroid Troupe? Who are they?</b>

16:31.120 --> 16:35.590
<b>A group of traveling entertainers,
led by a bard.</b>

16:35.590 --> 16:41.880
<b>The leader is a young person, but recently
their fame has been rapidly increasing.</b>

16:41.880 --> 16:45.180
<b>Traveling entertainers.
I can't wait to see them!</b>

16:45.180 --> 16:47.100
<b>Where will they be performing?</b>

16:47.100 --> 16:51.930
<b>We were thinking of using the empty lot
next to this establishment.</b>

16:51.930 --> 16:52.980
<b>Huh?</b>

16:52.980 --> 16:58.400
<b>Coming to think of it, the business
next door did move out recently.</b>

16:58.400 --> 17:05.110
<b>If possible, we'd like to borrow
part of this shop as a greenroom.</b>

17:05.110 --> 17:08.910
<b>I see. The shop might be difficult
to use for that purpose,</b>

17:08.910 --> 17:13.500
<b>but we have extra rooms in the dormitory.
Would that be all right?</b>

17:13.500 --> 17:18.590
<b>Oh, that would be wonderful. Thank you.</b>

17:18.590 --> 17:25.550
<b>Oh, no, I get your support all the time,
so it's the least I can do to repay you.</b>

17:33.100 --> 17:37.860
<b>Well, a lot happened today.
Now what shall I do...</b>

17:38.770 --> 17:41.610
<b>That voice... Miss Selma?!</b>

17:43.570 --> 17:46.240
<b>Miss Selma, what's wrong?!</b>

17:47.280 --> 17:52.870
<b>M-Manager, this smell...
The food in this barrel, it's rotten...</b>

17:52.870 --> 17:56.460
<b>Oh, no! I forgot about the shappaya!</b>

17:58.460 --> 17:59.540
<b>Hmm?</b>

18:00.840 --> 18:02.340
<b>What's wrong?</b>

18:02.340 --> 18:09.050
<b>Can you smell that?
It's quite familiar... Very fragrant!</b>

18:09.050 --> 18:11.970
<b>You're right! This is...</b>

18:14.640 --> 18:16.350
<b>It's semesa!</b>

18:16.350 --> 18:18.310
<b>Oh, can you tell?</b>

18:18.310 --> 18:20.980
<b>This aroma is so appetizing!</b>

18:20.980 --> 18:22.230
<b>Yes!</b>

18:22.230 --> 18:24.740
<b>It used to smell so bad...</b>

18:24.740 --> 18:29.120
<b>Oh, really? I can't tell at all.</b>

18:29.120 --> 18:31.580
<b>Yes. Actually...</b>

18:31.580 --> 18:35.290
<b>At first, we tried using the deodorizing
solution from the deodorant slime</b>

18:35.290 --> 18:38.870
<b>to remove the smell from this shappaya.</b>

18:38.870 --> 18:43.840
<b>That did work, and the smell
was improved quite a bit, but...</b>

18:51.100 --> 18:55.310
<b>Delicious! But this is,
how shall I say...</b>

18:55.310 --> 18:58.270
<b>Very distinct.</b>

18:58.270 --> 19:01.310
<b>The smell is still lingering.</b>

19:01.310 --> 19:06.320
<b>Maybe with a bit of flavor added through
herbs or something, it might be better.</b>

19:06.320 --> 19:13.160
<b>I see. Oh, I know,
can we do that with the semesa?</b>

19:13.160 --> 19:19.080
<b>So we squeezed some oil out of
the semesa from your village and fried it.</b>

19:19.080 --> 19:22.630
<b>The semesa aroma
is working well with this!</b>

19:22.630 --> 19:26.420
<b>I want to try it! I'll go get the others!</b>

19:27.590 --> 19:30.430
<b>I'm glad they like it.</b>

19:32.010 --> 19:34.810
<b>The food was delicious today as always!</b>

19:34.810 --> 19:37.220
<b>It's thanks to the manager and Miss Selma.</b>

19:37.220 --> 19:42.650
<b>You're welcome. What kind of cuisine
do you have from your home country?</b>

19:42.650 --> 19:43.980
<b>Are you interested?</b>

19:43.980 --> 19:49.650
<b>I was actually starting to miss it
a little, so I might try cooking it.</b>

19:50.650 --> 19:53.660
<b>Like the semesa and shappaya today,</b>

19:53.660 --> 19:57.700
<b>it's great being able to enjoy food
from many different areas.</b>

19:57.700 --> 19:58.540
<b>Hmm...</b>

19:58.540 --> 20:01.540
<b>Mr. Callum? Is something wrong?</b>

20:01.540 --> 20:04.090
<b>It might be a good idea to open a stall.</b>

20:04.090 --> 20:05.000
<b>Huh?</b>

20:05.000 --> 20:07.050
<b>At the Founding Festival.</b>

20:07.050 --> 20:12.220
<b>We can provide dishes from different areas
to people who come see the performance.</b>

20:12.220 --> 20:16.560
<b>Our business does have
employees from out of town,</b>

20:16.560 --> 20:19.270
<b>so we might be able to make
lots of different foods, but...</b>

20:19.270 --> 20:22.980
<b>People tend to spend more during festivals.</b>

20:22.980 --> 20:28.320
<b>Even without that, being able to communicate
more with the locals would be a good thing.</b>

20:28.320 --> 20:29.570
<b>Hmm.</b>

20:29.570 --> 20:36.580
<b>If doing a stall makes the people
in town happy, that's great, but...</b>

20:36.580 --> 20:38.540
<b>What do you think, everyone?</b>

20:38.540 --> 20:45.170
<b>It's extra work outside your usual duties,
so I can't force you.</b>

20:45.170 --> 20:47.420
<b>I'll help.</b>

20:47.420 --> 20:49.000
<b>Mr. Dolce?</b>

20:49.000 --> 20:50.800
<b>This is a good shop.</b>

20:50.800 --> 20:57.100
<b>I just joined recently,
but I want to stay.</b>

20:57.100 --> 21:00.270
<b>So I'd like to help, if possible.</b>

21:01.180 --> 21:06.060
<b>I enjoy having many people
enjoy my cooking.</b>

21:06.060 --> 21:08.360
<b>I'll help, too!</b>

21:08.360 --> 21:10.190
<b>Miss Selma...</b>

21:10.190 --> 21:13.780
<b>I'll show off some Gilmar cooking, too!</b>

21:13.780 --> 21:15.280
<b>I can't wait!</b>

21:15.280 --> 21:20.040
<b>I know! Can we use the wheat
from our village in that stall?</b>

21:20.040 --> 21:25.540
<b>As long as we can keep it stored fresh
until the festival, it should be fine.</b>

21:25.540 --> 21:30.340
<b>Yay! If we sold it at the stall,
maybe it'll help advertise our village.</b>

21:30.340 --> 21:35.180
<b>Do people really care about
where the wheat is from?</b>

21:35.180 --> 21:36.890
<b>Maybe not...</b>

21:36.890 --> 21:42.350
<b>But anyway, I support this. It sounds fun!</b>

21:42.350 --> 21:45.770
<b>In that case, we should start
preparing the decorations!</b>

21:45.770 --> 21:46.900
<b>Yes!</b>

21:46.900 --> 21:51.690
<b>So it's settled. We'll be joining
the festival as a stall.</b>

21:51.690 --> 21:53.240
<b>Yes!</b>

21:55.240 --> 21:59.620
<b>Everyone's looking forward
to the Founding Festival.</b>

21:59.620 --> 22:01.790
<b>I hope this goes well...</b>

22:03.750 --> 22:07.120
<b>No, I'll work hard to make it go well!</b>
